    "verified": true,
    "note": "2026 edition, released September 29, 2026; Innovation inputs SCORE column in the official Data sheet, covering all 139 economies. Edition year is not the observation year of every underlying indicator, which uses mixed reference years. Scores retain six decimal places; displayed scores are rounded to two decimals, so equal displayed values can have different ranks. Imported reproducibly with scripts/import-gii.py; future editions require review."
